 ```
 
+To give each dataset its own share of a step, set `data.num_prompts_per_dataloader` to a size per task name. The sizes must add up to `grpo.num_prompts_per_step`, and each dataset starts a new pass on its own when it runs out. This also works with async GRPO, where `grpo.max_num_epochs` counts passes of the dataset that needs the most steps:
+
+```yaml
+data:
+  use_multiple_dataloader: true
+  num_prompts_per_dataloader:
+    DAPOMath17K: 90
+    gsm8k: 38
+```
+
 For example, consider using `example_custom_dataloader`, which samples data from each dataloader sequentially.
 
 Given two datasets:
